{"title":"Photos of the Hands Off! Protests","link":"https://kottke.org/25/04/photos-of-the-hands-off-protests","date":1743964098000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hands-off-protests-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hands-off-protests-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hands-off-protests-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"867\" alt=\"protesters hold signs, including a large 'Hands Off!' sign\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hands-off-protests-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hands-off-protests-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hands-off-protests-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"867\" alt=\"protesters hold signs, including a large 'get out of my uterus' sign\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hands-off-protests-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hands-off-protests-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/hands-off-protests-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"867\" alt=\"protesters holding signs marching down the street in NYC\" /></p>\n\n<p>On Saturday, millions of Americans flooded the streets of cities, small towns, and every other sized municipality in the nation to <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/04/hands-off-a-day-of-action-and-protest-on-april-5\">protest</a> the illegal and damaging actions of the Trump regime. These photos published by a number of media outlets show the scale, enthusiasm, and creativity of these peaceful protests, in the US and around the world.</p>\n\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/photo/2025/04/photos-nationwide-protests-against-trump-and-musk/682320/\">Photos: Nationwide Protests Against Trump and Musk</a> (The Atlantic).</li>\n\n<p><li><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/gallery/2025/apr/05/anti-trump-hands-off-worldwide-protests\">Anti-Trump protests hit cities worldwide — in pictures</a> (The Guardian).</li></p>\n\n<p><li><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/sections/the-picture-show/2025/04/05/g-s1-58479/photos-see-hands-off-protests-trump-musk\">Photos: See demonstrators around the country rally in ‘Hands Off!’ protests</a> (NPR).</li></p>\n\n<p><li><a href=\"https://nymag.com/intelligencer/article/hands-off-mass-protests-against-trump-musk-photos-videos.html\">Scenes and Signs From Saturday’s Mass Anti-Trump Protests</a> (New York msagazine).</li></p>\n\n<p><li><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2025/04/05/hands-off-protest-movement-trump-musk\">In photos: “Hands Off!” protesters rally against Trump across the U.S.</a> (Axios).</li></p>\n\n<p><li><a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/trump-tariffs-protests-fcc6ee7ac555f4c08f9d499e30ce67e3\">PHOTO COLLECTION: Trump Hands Off Protests</a> (AP).</li></p>\n\n<p><li>A pair of threads on Bluesky from <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/jbendery.bsky.social/post/3lm3iz67bok2r\">@jbendery.bsky.social</a> and <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/kremlplots.bsky.social/post/3lm3htjfwno2j\">@kremlplots.bsky.social</a>.</li></p>\n\n<p><li><a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/us/trump-opponents-ready-take-streets-with-nationwide-protests-2025-04-05/\">Anti-Trump protesters gather in Washington, other US cities</a> (Reuters).</li></p></ul><p></p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/2025%20Coup\">2025 Coup</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Donald%20Trump\">Donald Trump</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Elon%20Musk\">Elon Musk</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/politics\">politics</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/USA\">USA</a></p>\n\n        \n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"9cc019af9e43e4e49023cab65e0a08bdc79fcdd319216dca4df03194cda041b0","category":"Sites"}